superred-target-injecagent

This module is a port of InjecAgent's agent-driving harness into the superred
red-teaming framework. Original code in this module (the superred adaptation: the
target, the agent/prompt builders, the ds-step-2 simulator, factories, and tests)
is licensed MIT (see LICENSE). It bundles benchmark data and reproduces prompt
construction and simulation from InjecAgent; the upstream MIT license text is
preserved verbatim in `src/injecagent_target/data/INJECAGENT_LICENSE` (and
`LICENSES/InjecAgent-MIT.txt`).

